    "body": "Not claimed. A Codex worker stopped before any change. Blocker facts:\n\n- This issue says \"Start after the 3D rough and finish case of #2392\". That case is #2866 (3D Pocket roughing and 3D Finish). #2866 is open. It has no claim, no assignee and no open PR.\n- `examples/catalog/3d/` does not exist on upstream/main.\n- Rest machining in the code is 2D only so far. Open issues #2033, #1446 and #2884, and open PR #2822 (2D Pocket rest), cover it. I found no rest-stock input on a 3D operation. The 3D rest case needs that input.\n\nSuggest: keep this issue after #2866, and check 3D rest support before it is picked. The maintainer decides.\n",
